{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serene Ponds is a relaxing, free-form pond-building sandbox where creativity flows with no rules, goals, or pressure.\u00a0Sculpt the land, decorate your pond, and watch a thriving frog community grow in harmony with the seasons. Take a deep breath and let nature unfold at your pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/624f87854c9411a58623e4dbdeea8d08.poster.avif?t=1765321503\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/624f87854c9411a58623e4dbdeea8d08.webm?t=1765321503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/624f87854c9411a58623e4dbdeea8d08.mp4?t=1765321503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your pond</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sculpt and paint the land to shape ponds, islands, and winding shorelines. Place rocks, lilies, reeds, and other natural props to set the scene, then unlock decorations like lanterns and statues to make your pond truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/b469350245fa1a94e64a7b2f0a80f137.poster.avif?t=1765321503\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/b469350245fa1a94e64a7b2f0a80f137.webm?t=1765321503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/b469350245fa1a94e64a7b2f0a80f137.mp4?t=1765321503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relax in nature</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chill out with a relaxing lofi soundtrack and layered ambient nature sounds. Toggle seasons, weather, and time of day to set the perfect mood. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/0ca38fed3438b9a7c405658b97dca2d4.poster.avif?t=1765321503\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/0ca38fed3438b9a7c405658b97dca2d4.webm?t=1765321503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/0ca38fed3438b9a7c405658b97dca2d4.mp4?t=1765321503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create a home for frogs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design unique pond layouts to attract different frog species, each drawn to specific environments. Name your frogs, watch them age, discover rare color variations, and meet their adorable froglets as they grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like what you see? Add Serene Ponds to your wishlist and join our cozy little frog-loving community as the game blossoms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3924840?t=1765321503","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3924840?t=1765321503","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/a1b811f7f1f867e3b71878c39dd3c778e730a505/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765321503","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/a1b811f7f1f867e3b71878c39dd3c778e730a505/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765321503","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serene Ponds is a relaxing, free-form pond-building sandbox where creativity flows with no rules, goals, or pressure.\u00a0Sculpt the land, decorate your pond, and watch a thriving frog community grow in harmony with the seasons. Take a deep breath and let nature unfold at your pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/624f87854c9411a58623e4dbdeea8d08.poster.avif?t=1765321503\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/624f87854c9411a58623e4dbdeea8d08.webm?t=1765321503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/624f87854c9411a58623e4dbdeea8d08.mp4?t=1765321503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your pond</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sculpt and paint the land to shape ponds, islands, and winding shorelines. Place rocks, lilies, reeds, and other natural props to set the scene, then unlock decorations like lanterns and statues to make your pond truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/b469350245fa1a94e64a7b2f0a80f137.poster.avif?t=1765321503\" width=800 height=342 